      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, top left corner, Hebrew addendum",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>the witnesses, and concerning this slander, and that which was taken from [his] taxes [?] [ ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>by //great// force, and he rejected it [and says], &lsquo;I am going to the sub-/vice-&rsquo;, [ ][and that to which they will testify in that regard is that [?]]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>they are numerous, and among them is the exalted sage K[avod] h[a-]R[av] [the honourable rabbi] [ ] [and K[avod] h[a-]R[av]]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Moshe \u02bfAt\u0323iyya and K[avod ha-] R[av] Avraham Ari\u0304pol and K[avod] h[a-]R[av]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Moshe Abi\u0304 \u02bfAt\u0323t\u0323a\u0304r and K[avod ha-] R[av] Moshe [ib]n Hi\u0304ni\u0304.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This was done by way of a ruse, until</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>he was rescued from his hand, from giving [i.e., paying] interest</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in front of the minister/vizier.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
